# The three edges at the corner of the extrusion of path_extrude nearest
# the viewer, picked with the mouse on the turned view and chamfered,
# then given a second distance of 2 on the chamfer's screen: a corner of
# chamfers of two distances, which the strips' cuts and a patch fill.
# The same as path_chamfer_corner.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/chamfer_corner).
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
# Its depth held and typed as 80 on its screen: the model was drawn
# for a deep part, deeper than a new extrusion of this sketch starts.
click-tw held
click-tw [change]
edit 80
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 305.9 136.6
down L 305.9 136.6
up L 305.9 136.6
move 446.6 165.2
down L 446.6 165.2
up L 446.6 165.2
move 295.8 380.6
down L 295.8 380.6
up L 295.8 380.6
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
click-tw #2 [change]
edit 2
